BT 1 0 0 1 0 54.5 Tm /F6+0 11.5 Tf 16.5 TL (The course opens with two preview lectures that recap an earlier course, \004Developing Soft Skills\005. That) Tj T* (course dealt with perception, self-management, excellence, conflict, stress, habits, listening, telephone) Tj T* (skills, technology, communication barriers, non-verbal communication, presentations, reading and trust.) Tj T* (The big new topic here is mindset: a person\001s habitual attitudes and ways of reading a situation.) Tj T* ET
