BT 1 0 0 1 0 71 Tm /F6+0 11.5 Tf 16.5 TL (Learning mindsets form early. A belief like \004I\001m not smart enough\005 limits a person, but it isn\001t a fact) Tj T* (about their ability. The suggested \004secrets\005 are to behave like a baby \(open and unafraid\), put up with) Tj T* (critical people, reject negative stereotypes and stereotype threat, and look for a sense of belonging. The) Tj T* (Hawthorne effect is offered as evidence that belonging and attention motivate people more than) Tj T* (incentives do.) Tj T* ET
