BT 1 0 0 1 0 104 Tm -0.124758 Tw /F6+0 11.5 Tf 16.5 TL (On anger, Aristotle\001s point is that the hard part is being angry at the right person, to the right degree, at the) Tj T* 0 Tw (right time. Techniques include postponing your reaction, counting, deep breathing, physical exertion,) Tj T* (Lincoln\001s unsent letter, silence and channelling anger into creative work. The lectures then turn to) Tj T* (positive thinking through the story of two hospital patients and a \004window\005 that faced a blank wall.) Tj T* (Changing negative thinking takes desire and determination, introspection and discarding limitations. It) Tj T* (also means building a positive self-image through repetition and visualisation, and bringing body, mind) Tj T* (and world into sync.) Tj T* ET
