BT 1 0 0 1 0 104 Tm /F6+0 11.5 Tf 16.5 TL (English is the global lingua franca, and avoiding common errors is presented as part of soft skills. Using) Tj T* (Sonia Sharma\001s Common Errors in English, the lectures work through repeated self-scored exercises and) Tj T* (explanations. Topics include confused word pairs \(resume/r\010sum\010, principal/principle, alone/lonely\),) Tj T* (Indianisms \(passed out, joint family, cousin brother\) and subject-verb agreement \(collective, uncountable) Tj T* (and plural-form nouns\). The lectures also cover prepositions \(since/for, at/in, by/on\), articles, collocations) Tj T* (and word choices like weather/climate. Twain and Branson are quoted on learning by exposure rather) Tj T* (than by memorising rules.) Tj T* ET
