BT 1 0 0 1 0 54.5 Tm /F6+0 11.5 Tf 16.5 TL (Values, ethics and etiquette make up character \(\004when character is lost, everything is lost\005\). Professional) Tj T* (ethics combine written codes with society\001s moral expectations. Poor etiquette and business etiquette are) Tj T* (covered in detail: introductions, not interrupting, confidentiality, not criticising your company, and) Tj T* (praising in public but reprimanding in private.) Tj T* ET
