BT 1 0 0 1 0 87.5 Tm /F6+0 11.5 Tf 16.5 TL (The mind is powerful but scattered, and it can be trained through auto-suggestion, positive self-talk and) Tj T* (effective thinking \(gather facts, sleep on it, trust your gut\). Memory techniques include association) Tj T* (through absurd images, remembering names and faces, number-image links, memory aids and mental) Tj T* (exercise. The final lecture urges care for the environment, with practical steps \(save water and electricity,) Tj T* (avoid plastic, use public transport, plant trees\) and a shift from anthropocentric to eco-centric thinking. It) Tj T* (closes with Gandhi\001s line that the earth provides enough for everyone\001s need but not everyone\001s greed.) Tj T* ET
