BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.4 Tm /F5+0 9.8 Tf 13.4 TL (In my hometown, as in many towns of Tamil Nadu, the temple car festival, or Ther Thiruvizha, is the biggest) Tj T* (event of the year. Thousands of devotees gather in the streets to watch the deity pulled in a huge, richly) Tj T* (decorated wooden chariot, called the ther.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
