BT 1 0 0 1 0 43.8 Tm /F5+0 9.8 Tf 13.4 TL (A regional folk art and handicraft fair is a colourful meeting of tradition and community. Walking through the fair) Tj T* (grounds, visitors see Karagattam and Oyilattam performances, hear the beat of the parai drum, and watch) Tj T* (artisans make Thanjavur dolls, palm-leaf baskets, clay pots and silk sarees. The air smells of fresh filter coffee,) Tj T* (murukku, adhirasam and hot sundal.) Tj T* ET
