BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.4 Tm /F5+0 9.8 Tf 13.4 TL (These fairs are important because they give artisans a market and help young people see the value of their) Tj T* (heritage. Many stalls offer live demonstrations, so children can try pottery or weaving themselves. Local) Tj T* (delicacies prepared by village cooks add to the festive atmosphere and support small businesses.) Tj T* ET
