BT 1 0 0 1 0 57.2 Tm /F5+0 9.8 Tf 13.4 TL (However, large fairs use a lot of electricity and produce a lot of waste. Modern environmental strategies can) Tj T* (solve this. Solar micro-grids, made of rooftop panels and batteries, can power the lights, sound systems and) Tj T* (stalls without diesel generators. Zero-waste composting can turn leftover food and leaves into manure for local) Tj T* (farms. Organisers can use reusable steel plates, clay cups and cloth banners, provide separate bins for wet and) Tj T* (dry waste, and recycle paper and cardboard.) Tj T* ET
