BT 1 0 0 1 0 43.8 Tm /F5+0 9.8 Tf 13.4 TL (Our department has planned a one-day technical study tour to the Mettur Dam on the Cauvery River in Salem) Tj T* (district. The group of forty students and two faculty members will leave the college by a chartered bus at 4:30) Tj T* (a.m. and travel along the national highway, with a short breakfast halt on the way. The journey takes about six) Tj T* (hours, and we will return by night. Students will carry ID cards, water bottles and a notebook.) Tj T* ET
