BT 1 0 0 1 0 57.2 Tm /F5+0 9.8 Tf 13.4 TL (After registering at the gate, an engineer will take us through the powerhouse. The long concrete dam holds) Tj T* (back the huge Stanley Reservoir. Inside the powerhouse, we will see the penstocks, the turbines and the) Tj T* (generators, and learn how falling water turns turbines to produce electricity. We will also observe the control) Tj T* (room, where operators monitor water level, flow and power output on screens, and the spillway gates used to) Tj T* (release extra water safely.) Tj T* ET
