BT 1 0 0 1 0 43.8 Tm /F5+0 9.8 Tf 13.4 TL (We plan a two-day study tour to the Muppandal wind farm region near Kanyakumari, where wind turbines and) Tj T* -0.02982 Tw (solar panels work together. Thirty students and two faculty members will take the overnight train from Chennai to) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.075462 Tw (Nagercoil, then travel about one hour by a hired van to the farm. We will stay one night in a budget lodge nearby,) Tj T* 0 Tw (and return by train on the second night.) Tj T* ET
