BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.4 Tm /F5+0 9.8 Tf 13.4 TL (Operating costs also differ. EVs have fewer moving parts, so they need less maintenance, and electricity per) Tj T* (kilometre is cheaper than petrol or diesel. On the other hand, ICE vehicles cost less to buy, and their repair) Tj T* (shops are available everywhere. Fuel prices, however, keep rising and make them costly to run.) Tj T* ET
Q
