1 0 0 1 54 683.0898 cm
q
.066667 .094118 .152941 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.4 Tm /F5+0 9.8 Tf 13.4 TL (Charging network feasibility is the biggest challenge for EVs. Charging stations are still limited, especially on) Tj T* (highways and in small towns, and charging takes much longer than refuelling. ICE vehicles, conversely, can be) Tj T* (refuelled in minutes at petrol stations spread across the country.) Tj T* ET
Q
