BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.4 Tm /F5+0 9.8 Tf 13.4 TL (In conclusion, EVs are cleaner and cheaper to run, whereas ICE vehicles are cheaper to buy and more) Tj T* (convenient at present. As battery prices fall and charging networks grow, EVs are likely to become the better) Tj T* (choice for the future.) Tj T* ET
